// building element. Initially the symbols ‘\[ul]’, ‘\[rn]’,
// ‘\[ru]’, ‘\[radicalex]’, and ‘\[sqrtex]’ have this property.
//
// 16
//
// The character overlaps vertically if used as vertical line building
// element. Initially symbol ‘\[br]’ has this property.
//
// 32
//
